{"strongs": "H3789", "word": "כָּתַב", "translit": "ka.tav", "root": "כשף", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "write", "definition": "כָּתַב 223 verb write (Late Hebrew id. ; Phoenician כתב ; Aramaic כְּתַב , Nabataean כתב , see especially Nö in Eut Nab. p. 43 ; thence Arabic Ethiopic book , Di Lex. 852 (as loan-words, Frä 249 DHM VOJ i (1887), 29 ); MV Buhl compare Arabic draw or sew together, conjoin (letters), etc., compare Fl ZMG 1873, 427 ) — Qal Perfect ׳ כ Josh 8:32 +, כָּתַבְתָּ Jer 36:6 +, suffix וּכְתַבְתָּם consecutive Deut 6:9 ; Deut 11:20 , etc. (Perfect 27 t.); Imperfect יִכְתֹּב Isa 44:5 , וַיִּכְתֹּב Exod 24:4 +, etc. (Imperfect 39 t.); Imperative כְּתֹב Isa 8:1 + 5 t., כְּתָבֿ Exod 34:27 + 2 t.; suffix כָּתְבָהּ Isa 30:8 , כָּתְבֵם Prov 3:3 ; Prov 7:3 plural כִּתְבוּ Deut 31:9 + 3 t .; Infinitive absolute כָּתוֺכ Jer 32:44 cstr כְּתוֺב Ps 87:8 , לִכְתֹּב Deut 31:24 ; Josh 18:8 suffix כָּתְבוֺ Jer 45:1 Participle active כֹּתֵב Jer 36:18 , plural כֹּתְבִים Jer 32:12 ; Neh 10:1 passive (113 t.), כָּתוּב Josh 1:8 +, feminine כְּתוּבָה 2Sam 1:18 +, plural כְּתוּבִים 1Kgs 15:7 +, כְּתֻבִים 1Kgs 11:41 +; feminine plural כְּתוּבוֺת 2Chr 34:24 — 1. write: \\ \\ a. with accusative, words Exod 34:27 , commandments Exod 24:12 , etc.; accusative of congnate meaning with verb מכתב Exod 39:30 , compare כַּמִּכְתָּב Deut 10:4 with כְּ , giving purport of writing, also Esth 8:8 but object also a book, סֵפֶר Exod 32:32 ; Deut 24:1 מְגִלָּה Jer 38:6 , compare participle pass, וְהִיא כְּתוּבָה פָּנִים וְאָחוֺר Ezek 2:10 ( of מגלה ; i.e. written on both sides); a letter, סֵפָר 2Sam 11:14 ; 2Kgs 10:1 + 4 t., אִגֶּרֶת 2Chr 30:1 a divorce-certificate סֵפֶר כְּרִיתֻת Deut 24:1 , etc.; even לֻחֹת כְּתֻבִים tablets inscribed by the finger of God Exod 31:18 compare Deut 9:10 מִשְּׁנֵי עֶבְרֵיהֶם ׳ כ ׳ ל Exod 32:15 tables inscribed on both sides (compare Ezek 2:10 above) Here belongs (probably) ׳ וְזֶה יִכְתֹּב יָדוֺ לי Isa 44:5 and this one shall inscribe his hand, 'Yahweh's' , so ᵐ5 Hi Kn Che Br Du Di , Ges Ew De , shall sign (with) his hand unto ׳ י . \\ \\ b. more often write something on , or in ( עַלֿ 85 t., בְ 44 t., אֶלֿ 3 t.) a tablet, roll, book, etc. (object various, as above): — (I) עַלֿ ׳ כ followed by סֵפֶר = book Deut 17:18 + 55 t., especially in phrase ׳ כתובים עלסֿפר דברי וגו 1Kgs 11:41 + often Kings Chronicles; עַלמְֿגִּלָּה ׳ כ Jer 36:2 ; Jer 36:28 ; Jer 36:32 ; Jer 38:29 עַללֿוּח(ותׅ ׳ כ Exod 34:1 + 7 t., עַלאֶֿבֶן Deut 27:3 + 2 t., עַלגּֿלָּיוֺן Isa 8:1 עַלמְֿזֻזוֺת בַּיִת Deut 6:9 ; Deut 11:20 עַלמַֿטֶּה on a rod Num 17:17 ; Num 17:18 עַלעֵֿץ Ezek 37:16 (twice in verse), עַלצִֿיץ (high priest's plate) Exod 39:30 even (only Chronicles) עַלֿ followed by name of book or its contents: — עַלדִּֿבְרֵי נָתָן ׳ כ 2Chr 9:29 compare 2Chr 33:19 ׳ עַלמִֿדְרַשׁ וגו 2Chr 24:27 עַלהַֿקִּינוֺת 2Chr 35:25 figurative, עַללִֿבָּם ׳ כ Jer 31:83 I will write them upon their heart ; compare עַללֿוּחַ לִבֶּ֑ךָ ׳ כ Prov 3:3 . (2) אֶלֿ ׳ כ appears for עַלֿ ׳ כ only Jer 36:2 compare Ezek 2:10 ; Jer 51:60 . (3) בְּ ׳ כ followed by ספר = book Josh 24:26 ( E ) + 35 t.; = letter, bill, deed , 1Kgs 21:9 + 5 t.; בִּמְגִלַּת סֵפֶר כָּתוּב עָלָ֑י Ps 40:8 it is prescribed to me , על as 2Kgs 22:13 ( N.B. עלֿ ׳ כ not used with סֵפֶר = letter , and בְּ ׳ כ not used with לוּחַ , אבן or עֵץ ). \\ \\ c. other uses of perp. with ׳ כ are: — בְּ instrumental, בְּחֶרֶט אֱנוֺשׁ ׳ כ Isa 8:1 , בְּעֵט בַּרְזֶל ׳ כ Jer 17:1 כְּתֻבִים בְּאֶצְבַּע אֱלֹהִים Deut 9:10 ; Exod 31:18 אֶלֿ ׳ כ unto , of person to whom letter, etc., is addressed 2Sam 11:14 ; 2Kgs 10:6 ; Esth 9:13 עַלֿ substantive for אֶלֿ (late) 2Chr 30:1 ; Ezra 4:7 ; Esth 8:8 the fuller construction is ספר וישׁלח (אֶלֿׅ ׳ כ 2Kgs 10:1 ; Esth 8:10 ; Esth 9:20 +; אֶלֿ ׳ כ write down for the benefit or use of some one, Judg 8:14 לְ to or for , Deut 17:18 ; Deut 24:1 +; note especially אֶכְתָּו֯בלֿוֺ רֻבֵּו֯ תּוֺרָתִי Hos 8:12 , i.e. either, I write (keep writing) for them ever so many ( We , רֹב , compare Ew and most רִבּוֺ(אׅ a myriad) of my directions , or 'Though I write,' 'Were I to write,' etc.; ׳ כ followed by ל with infinitive of purpose 2Chr 32:17 ; Esth 8:5 with מִן in phrase ׳ מִפִּי פ ׳ כ write from the mouth of any one i.e. from dictation, Jer 36:2 ; Jer 36:32 ; Jer 38:6 ; Jer 38:17 ; Jer 38:27 ; Jer 45:1 . 2. = write down describe in writing , אֶתהָֿאָרֶץ ׳ כ Judg 18:4 ; Judg 18:6 ; Judg 18:8 (3 t. in verse); Judg 18:9 . 3. = register enroll Isa 10:19 (= record the number), 1Chr 24:6 especially passive הַכְּתוּבִים Num 11:26 those enrolled compare Neh 12:22 בְּשֵׁמוֺת ׳ הַכּ 1Chr 4:41 those recorded by name ; in prediction, אֶתהָֿאִישׁ ׳ כ הַזֶּה עֲרִירִי Jer 22:30 register this man as childless ; with eschatological reference, כָּלהַֿכָּתוּב לַחַיִּים Isa 4:3 all those enrolled (i.e. appointed) unto life ; and, more explicitly, כָּלהַֿנִּמְצָא כָּתוּב בַּסֵּפֶר Dan 12:1 יִסְפֹּר בִּכְתוֺבּ עַמִּים ׳ י Ps 87:6 ׳ י shall reckon, when he registers (note absence of suffix) the peoples , etc. 4. = decree , תִּכְתֹּב עָלַי מְרֹרוֺת Job 13:26 thou ( ׳ י ) decrest against me bitter things. Niph`al (chiefly late, especially Esther), Imperfect יִכָּתֵב Esth 1:19 +, 3 feminine singular תִּכָּ֫תֶב זֹאת Ps 102:19 3 masculine plural יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ Jer 17:13 + 3 t., יִכָּֽתְבוּן Job 19:23 Participle נִכְתָּב Esth 3:12 + 2 t.; — 1. be written , subject words Job 19:23 , book Mal 3:16 be written בְּסֵפֶר Esth 2:23 ; Esth 9:23 , in, or among ב the laws Esth 1:19 once, with עַלֿ , עַלסִֿפְרְךָ כֻּלָּם יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ Ps 139:16 in thy ׳ י 's book all of them (my members) are written , i.e. written down, recorded (see below); absolute כְּתָב אֲשֶׁר נִכְתָּב בְּשֵׁם הַמֶּלֶךְ Esth 8:8 a writing which is written in the king's name , compare (impersonal) Esth 3:12 impersonal also וַיִּכָּתֵב כְּכָלאֲֿשֶׁר צִוָּה Esth 3:12 ; Esth 8:9 ׳ יִכָּ followed by לְ = for Ps 102:19 followed by לְ + infinitive (really = a subject-cl., — the contents of the letter) Esth 3:9 ; Esth 8:5 . 2. be written down, recorded , Ezra 8:34 enrolled , בִּכְתָב בית ישׂראל לֹא יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ Ezek 13:9 in the enrolement of the house of Israel they are not enrolled (eschatolog.); וְעִםצַֿדִּיקִים אַליִֿכָּתֵ֑בוּ Ps 69:29 (|| חַיִּים יִמָּחוּ מִסֵּפֶר ) — בָּאָרֶץ יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ Jer 17:13 is difficult; Gie reads, plausibly, מֵאֶרֶץ יִכָּרֵ֑תוּ (compare Ps 34:17 ; Ps 101:8 , etc.) Pi`el frequently, Perfect and Participle , only כִּתֵּ֑בוּוּמְכַתְּבִים עָמָל Isa 10:1 and busy writers that make a business of writing oppression (i.e. register unjust sentences, compare Qal 4 ; || הַחֹקֲקִים חִקֲקֵיאָֿוֶן ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4239')\">BDB4239</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3789')\">H3789</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4238')\">BDB4238</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4240')\">BDB4240</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>כָּתַב</bdbheb><sub>223</sub> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>write</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Phoenician <bdbheb>כתב</bdbheb>; Aramaic <bdbarc>כְּתַב</bdbarc>, <placeholder2678/> Nabataean <bdbheb>כתב</bdbheb>, see especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Eut')\">Eut<sup>Nab. p. 43</sup></lookup>; thence Arabic <placeholder2679/> Ethiopic <placeholder2680/> <highlight>book</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di<sup>Lex. 852</sup></lookup> (as loan-words, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Frä')\">Frä<sup>249</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>VOJ i (1887), 29</sup></lookup>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MV')\">MV</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl</lookup> compare Arabic <placeholder2681/> <highlight>draw or sew together, conjoin</highlight> (letters), etc., compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Fl')\">Fl<sup>ZMG 1873, 427</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 8:32\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,32)\">Josh 8:32</ref> +, <bdbheb>כָּתַבְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 36:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,6)\">Jer 36:6</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>וּכְתַבְתָּם</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Deut 6:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,9)\">Deut 6:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 11:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,20)\">Deut 11:20</ref>, etc. (Perfect 27 t.); <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִכְתֹּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 44:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,5)\">Isa 44:5</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיִּכְתֹּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 24:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,4)\">Exod 24:4</ref> +, etc. (Imperfect 39 t.); <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>כְּתֹב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,1)\">Isa 8:1</ref> + 5 t., <bdbheb>כְּתָבֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 34:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,27)\">Exod 34:27</ref> + 2 t.; suffix <bdbheb>כָּתְבָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,8)\">Isa 30:8</ref>, <bdbheb>כָּתְבֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 3:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,3)\">Prov 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 7:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,7,3)\">Prov 7:3</ref> plural <bdbheb>כִּתְבוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 31:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,9)\">Deut 31:9</ref> + 3 t .; <highlight>Infinitive absolute</highlight> <bdbheb>כָּתוֺכ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 32:44\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,44)\">Jer 32:44</ref> <highlight>cstr</highlight> <bdbheb>כְּתוֺב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 87:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"87\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"87\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,87,8)\">Ps 87:8</ref>, <bdbheb>לִכְתֹּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 31:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,24)\">Deut 31:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 18:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,18,8)\">Josh 18:8</ref> suffix <bdbheb>כָּתְבוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 45:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,45,1)\">Jer 45:1</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> <bdbheb>כֹּתֵב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 36:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,18)\">Jer 36:18</ref>, plural <bdbheb>כֹּתְבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 32:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,12)\">Jer 32:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 10:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,1)\">Neh 10:1</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> (113 t.), <bdbheb>כָּתוּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 1:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,1,8)\">Josh 1:8</ref> +, feminine <bdbheb>כְּתוּבָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:18\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,18)\">2Sam 1:18</ref> +, plural <bdbheb>כְּתוּבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,7)\">1Kgs 15:7</ref> +, <bdbheb>כְּתֻבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:41\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,41)\">1Kgs 11:41</ref> +; feminine plural <bdbheb>כְּתוּבוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:24\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,24)\">2Chr 34:24</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>write:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> with accusative, words <ref ref=\"Exod 34:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,27)\">Exod 34:27</ref>, commandments <ref ref=\"Exod 24:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,24,12)\">Exod 24:12</ref>, etc.; accusative of congnate meaning with verb <bdbheb>מכתב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 39:30\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(2,39,30)\">Exod 39:30</ref>, compare <bdbheb>כַּמִּכְתָּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 10:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,4)\">Deut 10:4</ref> with <bdbheb>כְּ</bdbheb>, giving purport of writing, also <ref ref=\"Esth 8:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,8)\">Esth 8:8</ref> but object also a book, <bdbheb>סֵפֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:32\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,32)\">Exod 32:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 24:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,1)\">Deut 24:1</ref> <bdbheb>מְגִלָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 38:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,6)\">Jer 38:6</ref>, compare participle pass, <bdbheb>וְהִיא כְּתוּבָה פָּנִים וְאָחוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 2:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,2,10)\">Ezek 2:10</ref> ( of <bdbheb>מגלה</bdbheb>; i.e. written on both sides); a letter, <bdbheb>סֵפָר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,14)\">2Sam 11:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,1)\">2Kgs 10:1</ref> + 4 t., <bdbheb>אִגֶּרֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,1)\">2Chr 30:1</ref> a divorce-certificate <bdbheb>סֵפֶר כְּרִיתֻת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 24:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,1)\">Deut 24:1</ref>, etc.; even <bdbheb>לֻחֹת כְּתֻבִים</bdbheb> <highlight>tablets inscribed</highlight> by the finger of God <ref ref=\"Exod 31:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,18)\">Exod 31:18</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Deut 9:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,10)\">Deut 9:10</ref> <bdbheb>מִשְּׁנֵי עֶבְרֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,15)\">Exod 32:15</ref> <highlight>tables inscribed on both sides</highlight> (compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 2:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,2,10)\">Ezek 2:10</ref> above) Here belongs (probably) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְזֶה יִכְתֹּב יָדוֺ לי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 44:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,5)\">Isa 44:5</ref> <highlight>and this one shall</highlight> <highlight>inscribe his hand, 'Yahweh's'</highlight>, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kn')\">Kn</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Br')\">Br</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup>, <highlight>shall sign</highlight> (with) <highlight>his hand unto</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> more often <highlight>write</highlight> something <highlight>on</highlight>, or <highlight>in</highlight> (<bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> 85 t., <bdbheb>בְ</bdbheb> 44 t., <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> 3 t.) a tablet, roll, book, etc. (object various, as above): — (I) <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> followed by <bdbheb>סֵפֶר</bdbheb> = <highlight>book</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 17:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,18)\">Deut 17:18</ref> + 55 t., especially in phrase <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כתובים עלסֿפר דברי וגו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:41\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,41)\">1Kgs 11:41</ref> + often Kings Chronicles; <bdbheb>עַלמְֿגִּלָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 36:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,2)\">Jer 36:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 36:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,28)\">Jer 36:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 36:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,32)\">Jer 36:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 38:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,29)\">Jer 38:29</ref> <bdbheb>עַללֿוּח(ותׅ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 34:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,1)\">Exod 34:1</ref> + 7 t., <bdbheb>עַלאֶֿבֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 27:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,27,3)\">Deut 27:3</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>עַלגּֿלָּיוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,1)\">Isa 8:1</ref> <bdbheb>עַלמְֿזֻזוֺת בַּיִת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 6:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,6,9)\">Deut 6:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 11:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,20)\">Deut 11:20</ref> <bdbheb>עַלמַֿטֶּה</bdbheb> <highlight>on a rod</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 17:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,17)\">Num 17:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,18)\">Num 17:18</ref> <bdbheb>עַלעֵֿץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 37:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,37,16)\">Ezek 37:16</ref> (twice in verse), <bdbheb>עַלצִֿיץ</bdbheb> (high priest's plate) <ref ref=\"Exod 39:30\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(2,39,30)\">Exod 39:30</ref> even (only Chronicles) <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> followed by name of book or its contents: — <bdbheb>עַלדִּֿבְרֵי נָתָן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:29\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,29)\">2Chr 9:29</ref> compare <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,19)\">2Chr 33:19</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַלמִֿדְרַשׁ וגו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 24:27\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(14,24,27)\">2Chr 24:27</ref> <bdbheb>עַלהַֿקִּינוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:25\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,25)\">2Chr 35:25</ref> figurative, <bdbheb>עַללִֿבָּם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Jer 31:83\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"83\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"83\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,83)\">Jer 31:83</ref> <highlight>I will write them upon their heart</highlight>; compare <bdbheb>עַללֿוּחַ לִבֶּ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 3:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,3)\">Prov 3:3</ref>. (2) <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> appears for <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> only <ref ref=\"Jer 36:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,2)\">Jer 36:2</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 2:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,2,10)\">Ezek 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:60\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"60\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"60\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,60)\">Jer 51:60</ref>. (3) <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> followed by <bdbheb>ספר</bdbheb> = <highlight>book</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 24:26\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(6,24,26)\">Josh 24:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) + 35 t.; = <highlight>letter, bill, deed</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:9\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,9)\">1Kgs 21:9</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>בִּמְגִלַּת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>סֵפֶר כָּתוּב עָלָ֑י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 40:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,8)\">Ps 40:8</ref> <highlight>it is prescribed to me</highlight>, <bdbheb>על</bdbheb> as <ref ref=\"2Kgs 22:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,22,13)\">2Kgs 22:13</ref> (</div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>N.B.</b> <bdbheb>עלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> not used with <bdbheb>סֵפֶר</bdbheb> = <highlight>letter</highlight>, and <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> not used with <bdbheb>לוּחַ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>אבן</bdbheb> or <bdbheb>עֵץ</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> other uses of perp. with <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> are: — <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> instrumental, <bdbheb>בְּחֶרֶט אֱנוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,1)\">Isa 8:1</ref>, <bdbheb>בְּעֵט בַּרְזֶל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 17:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,1)\">Jer 17:1</ref> <bdbheb>כְּתֻבִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בְּאֶצְבַּע אֱלֹהִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 9:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,10)\">Deut 9:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 31:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,18)\">Exod 31:18</ref> <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <highlight>unto</highlight>, of person to whom letter, etc., is addressed <ref ref=\"2Sam 11:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,11,14)\">2Sam 11:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:6\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,6)\">2Kgs 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:13\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,13)\">Esth 9:13</ref> <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> substantive for <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> (late) <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,1)\">2Chr 30:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:7\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,7)\">Ezra 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,8)\">Esth 8:8</ref> the fuller construction is <bdbheb>ספר וישׁלח (אֶלֿׅ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 10:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,10,1)\">2Kgs 10:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:10\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,10)\">Esth 8:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:20\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,20)\">Esth 9:20</ref> +; <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <highlight>write down for</highlight> the benefit or use of some one, <ref ref=\"Judg 8:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,14)\">Judg 8:14</ref> <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <highlight>to or for</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Deut 17:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,17,18)\">Deut 17:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 24:1\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,1)\">Deut 24:1</ref> +; note especially <bdbheb>אֶכְתָּו֯בלֿוֺ רֻבֵּו֯ תּוֺרָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 8:12\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,12)\">Hos 8:12</ref>, i.e. either, <highlight>I write (keep writing) for them ever so many</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup>, <bdbheb>רֹב</bdbheb>, compare <placeholder2682/> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> and most <bdbheb>רִבּוֺ(אׅ</bdbheb> a myriad) <highlight>of my directions</highlight>, or <highlight>'Though I write,' 'Were I to write,'</highlight> etc.; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> followed by <bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> with infinitive of purpose <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,17)\">2Chr 32:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:5\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,5)\">Esth 8:5</ref> with <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> in phrase <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִפִּי פ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <highlight>write from the mouth of</highlight> any one i.e. from dictation, <ref ref=\"Jer 36:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,2)\">Jer 36:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 36:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,32)\">Jer 36:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 38:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,6)\">Jer 38:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 38:17\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,17)\">Jer 38:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 38:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,27)\">Jer 38:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 45:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,45,1)\">Jer 45:1</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> = <highlight>write down describe in writing</highlight>, <bdbheb>אֶתהָֿאָרֶץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 18:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,4)\">Judg 18:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 18:6\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,6)\">Judg 18:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 18:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,8)\">Judg 18:8</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Judg 18:9\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,9)\">Judg 18:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> = <highlight>register enroll</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,19)\">Isa 10:19</ref> (= record the number), <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,6)\">1Chr 24:6</ref> especially passive <bdbheb>הַכְּתוּבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,26)\">Num 11:26</ref> <highlight>those enrolled</highlight> compare <ref ref=\"Neh 12:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,22)\">Neh 12:22</ref> <bdbheb>בְּשֵׁמוֺת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַכּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:41\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,41)\">1Chr 4:41</ref> <highlight>those recorded by name</highlight>; in prediction, <bdbheb>אֶתהָֿאִישׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַזֶּה עֲרִירִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 22:30\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(24,22,30)\">Jer 22:30</ref> <highlight>register this man as childless</highlight>; with eschatological reference, <bdbheb>כָּלהַֿכָּתוּב לַחַיִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 4:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,3)\">Isa 4:3</ref> <highlight>all those enrolled</highlight> (i.e. appointed) <highlight>unto life</highlight>; and, more explicitly, <bdbheb>כָּלהַֿנִּמְצָא כָּתוּב בַּסֵּפֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 12:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,1)\">Dan 12:1</ref> <bdbheb>יִסְפֹּר בִּכְתוֺבּ עַמִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 87:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"87\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"87\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,87,6)\">Ps 87:6</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <highlight>shall reckon, when he registers</highlight> (note absence of suffix) <highlight>the</highlight> <highlight>peoples</highlight>, etc. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> = <highlight>decree</highlight>, <bdbheb>תִּכְתֹּב עָלַי מְרֹרוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 13:26\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(18,13,26)\">Job 13:26</ref> <highlight>thou</highlight> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>) <highlight>decrest against me bitter things.</highlight> <b>Niph`al</b> (chiefly late, especially Esther), <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִכָּתֵב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 1:19\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,19)\">Esth 1:19</ref> +, 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תִּכָּ֫תֶב זֹאת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 102:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,19)\">Ps 102:19</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 17:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,13)\">Jer 17:13</ref> + 3 t., <bdbheb>יִכָּֽתְבוּן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 19:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,23)\">Job 19:23</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נִכְתָּב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 3:12\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(17,3,12)\">Esth 3:12</ref> + 2 t.; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be written</highlight>, subject words <ref ref=\"Job 19:23\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,23)\">Job 19:23</ref>, book <ref ref=\"Mal 3:16\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,16)\">Mal 3:16</ref> <highlight>be written</highlight> <bdbheb>בְּסֵפֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 2:23\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,23)\">Esth 2:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:23\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,23)\">Esth 9:23</ref>, <highlight>in, or among</highlight> <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> the laws <ref ref=\"Esth 1:19\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,19)\">Esth 1:19</ref> once, with <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>עַלסִֿפְרְךָ כֻּלָּם יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 139:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"139\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"139\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,139,16)\">Ps 139:16</ref> <highlight>in thy</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s <highlight>book all of them</highlight> (my members) <highlight>are written</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>written down, recorded</highlight> (see below); absolute <bdbheb>כְּתָב אֲשֶׁר נִכְתָּב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בְּשֵׁם הַמֶּלֶךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 8:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,8)\">Esth 8:8</ref> <highlight>a writing which is written in the king's name</highlight>, compare (impersonal) <ref ref=\"Esth 3:12\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(17,3,12)\">Esth 3:12</ref> impersonal also <bdbheb>וַיִּכָּתֵב כְּכָלאֲֿשֶׁר צִוָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 3:12\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(17,3,12)\">Esth 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:9\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,9)\">Esth 8:9</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יִכָּ</bdbheb> followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> = <highlight>for</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 102:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"102\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"102\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,102,19)\">Ps 102:19</ref> followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> + infinitive (really = a subject-cl., — the contents of the letter) <ref ref=\"Esth 3:9\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(17,3,9)\">Esth 3:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:5\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,5)\">Esth 8:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be written down, recorded</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:34\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,34)\">Ezra 8:34</ref> <highlight>enrolled</highlight>, <bdbheb>בִּכְתָב</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בית ישׂראל לֹא יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 13:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,13,9)\">Ezek 13:9</ref> <highlight>in the enrolement of the house of Israel they are not enrolled</highlight> (eschatolog.); <bdbheb>וְעִםצַֿדִּיקִים אַליִֿכָּתֵ֑בוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 69:29\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"69\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"69\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(19,69,29)\">Ps 69:29</ref> (|| <bdbheb>חַיִּים יִמָּחוּ מִסֵּפֶר</bdbheb>) — <bdbheb>בָּאָרֶץ יִכָּתֵ֑בוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 17:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,13)\">Jer 17:13</ref> is difficult; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie</lookup> reads, plausibly, <bdbheb>מֵאֶרֶץ יִכָּרֵ֑תוּ</bdbheb> (compare <ref ref=\"Ps 34:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,34,17)\">Ps 34:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 101:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"101\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"101\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,101,8)\">Ps 101:8</ref>, etc.) <b>Pi`el</b> frequently, <highlight>Perfect</highlight> and <highlight>Participle</highlight>, only <bdbheb>כִּתֵּ֑בוּוּמְכַתְּבִים עָמָל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,1)\">Isa 10:1</ref> and <highlight>busy writers that make a business of writing</highlight> oppression (i.e. register unjust sentences, compare <b>Qal 4</b>; || <bdbheb>הַחֹקֲקִים חִקֲקֵיאָֿוֶן</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Josh 8:32", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 8, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Jer 36:6", "book": "JER", "chapter": 36, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Deut 6:9", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 6, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Deut 11:20", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 11, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Isa 44:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 44, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Exod 24:4", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 24, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Isa 8:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Exod 34:27", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 34, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Isa 30:8", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 30, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Prov 3:3", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Prov 7:3", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 7, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Deut 31:9", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 31, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Jer 32:44", "book": "JER", "chapter": 32, "verse": 44}, {"raw": "Ps 87:8", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 87, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Deut 31:24", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 31, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Josh 18:8", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 18, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Jer 45:1", "book": "JER", "chapter": 45, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Jer 36:18", "book": "JER", "chapter": 36, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Jer 32:12", "book": "JER", "chapter": 32, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Neh 10:1", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 10, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Josh 1:8", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 1, "verse": 8}, {"raw": 